{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "locale": "zh-CN",
  "scenario_id": "1_2_011_01_a",
  "source_raw_hash": "sha256:24693f6a8d4c17ed7c95518e4ea3fa9e679509001b5f913a3a0759da5848557f",
  "entries": {
    "story-text:v1:1_2_011min_01_1_2_011_01:1_2_011_01_a:cmd-000000:title:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:961439db6cc42a620cb6ff74340234958484432d75a6ed50d211e88e1ec64673",
      "text": "鲜花与摩托",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_011min_01_1_2_011_01:1_2_011_01_a:cmd-000000:synopsis:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:2d5a930717a6a38bb9346afba962a4d62866e042c0cf5b3edaaa2a61405dcdb5",
      "text": "为了给共演者送上插花作为生日礼物，实和制作人来到了他曾工作过的花店挑选鲜花。在制作插花的过程中，实回想起了刚成为花店店员时的情景。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_011min_01_1_2_011_01:1_2_011_01_a:cmd-000010:title:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:7824b3a8948acd2c72636875e79b09adab6d8fca3c20b65cfcfd68e8d3eae4ba",
      "text": "第1话",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_011min_01_1_2_011_01:1_2_011_01_a:cmd-000010:title:001": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:961439db6cc42a620cb6ff74340234958484432d75a6ed50d211e88e1ec64673",
      "text": "鲜花与摩托",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_011min_01_1_2_011_01:1_2_011_01_a:cmd-000017:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:4642a885dd1b8a29cea9f4eb93f55766755575a7d0f6021aa272020b1b3ec898",
      "text": "说的也是，这个时节的话应该选银莲花吧……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_011min_01_1_2_011_01:1_2_011_01_a:cmd-000021:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6bab9b00566fa98162c048fa297eca9f5f6b5ffc70432dae74c918eaebd9bef6",
      "text": "●●●●プロデューサー帮忙打听到了共演者喜欢白色，那颜色就统一选白色吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_011min_01_1_2_011_01:1_2_011_01_a:cmd-000028:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d74c8d8a79bb2766a635878e38d2edef1c92e11458d665fa5f4273e754489a34",
      "text": "花语也很合适呢！\n白色银莲花的花语是“希望”。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_011min_01_1_2_011_01:1_2_011_01_a:cmd-000032:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:45836edec627541a86d492a3bf26bf30fd92f7ee21a510ba7bc074ec1418d512",
      "text": "“希望”……用来作为生日礼物的\n插花真是再合适不过了呢！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_011min_01_1_2_011_01:1_2_011_01_a:cmd-000038:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:59c337929524f8826300024f703d6acba7ac40a734285acaf71fcedcef4d78e2",
      "text": "啊，这边的白非洲菊也用上吧。\n它的花语同样是“希望”哦。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_011min_01_1_2_011_01:1_2_011_01_a:cmd-000041:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f2fc4be75ab696ef349dcc71219ef405016dcebe1687055da29b75d042387a1f",
      "text": "那么，送的花就以白银莲花和白非洲菊为主吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_011min_01_1_2_011_01:1_2_011_01_a:cmd-000048:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:fcb42e1414f21a0684c824f6a228ba7a6aa233215c95c86eeedf9dd3e4f0e0f7",
      "text": "嗯，就这么定。……好啦，\n花也挑完了。接下来就包在我身上吧！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_011min_01_1_2_011_01:1_2_011_01_a:cmd-000074:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:074eae446427cedf5eb0521bd4644cf00d1728b81482c80db8996431157fb3da",
      "text": "呼，大概是这种感觉吧。\n你觉得怎么样？●●●●プロデューサー。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_011min_01_1_2_011_01:1_2_011_01_a:cmd-000078:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:4694d2dc8a2b6dde84602f8c2b266bdd261ea6f5899bbd9862c9b4b0e016256d",
      "text": "我觉得非常棒！\n实先生真厉害啊……！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_011min_01_1_2_011_01:1_2_011_01_a:cmd-000083:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a00a42d03987b436735243fc14f2495be83f5462443b70ac4ed1ccdc7a56686e",
      "text": "哈哈，手艺没生疏真是太好了。\n刚去花店工作那会儿可是吃了不少苦头呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    }
  }
}
